## Modifications

In accordance with section 5(a) of the GPL, the changes made in this copy are listed
below, with dates.

### 2026-10-13 — grid layout and mini window

- `gridplayer/widgets/grid_splitter.py` (new) — a splitter with a self-drawn handle,
  used to make cell boundaries draggable.
- `gridplayer/player/managers/grid.py` — optional "resizable cells" mode that renders
  the grid through nested splitters, plus saving and restoring the proportions.
- `gridplayer/player/managers/mini_window.py` (new) — float one video into a small
  window of its own and reflow the rest around it.
- `gridplayer/player/managers/base.py` — `is_elsewhere()` now also reports a press
  inside a floating window as belonging to that window rather than the video under it.
- `gridplayer/models/grid_state.py`, `gridplayer/models/playlist.py`,
  `gridplayer/playlist_settings.py`, `gridplayer/params/defaults_fields.py`,
  `gridplayer/params/actions.py`, `gridplayer/params/menu.py`, `gridplayer/settings.py`,
  `gridplayer/player/player.py` — wiring for the above.
- `tests/test_grid_splitter.py`, `tests/test_mini_window.py` (new),
  `tests/test_managers_grid.py` — tests.

### 2026-10-14 — Windows packaging

- `scripts/pyinstaller/build_win.sh` — fall back to `curl` when `wget` is absent.
- `scripts/windows/build_packages.sh` — locate `ISCC.exe` in the per-user install
  location as well as `Program Files`.
- `scripts/windows/installer.iss` — always show the folder page, do not reuse a previous
  install directory, remove a previous build's runtime folders before unpacking, and
  install per-user so no elevation is required.
- `scripts/windows/generate_file_associations.py` — write file associations under `HKA`
  instead of `HKCR`, which cannot be written without elevation.
- `README.md` — rewritten for this fork: the origin stated, download links pointed at
  this repository, upstream-only install routes marked as such.
- `.gitignore` — ignore `temp/` and `data/`.

